        "text_n6debM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text_position": "center",
            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Trusted Source for Pruning and Garden Tools in Aspen, CO Since 1989",
            "text": "<p>Trimming tall trees or shaping thick shrubs in the Aspen area can be a challenge without the right tools in hand. For over three decades, Rivendell Distribution has helped Colorado locals find pruning tools that are easy to use, made to last, and built for real yard work. Whether you’re looking for<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hand+Tools\" target=\"_blank\"> hand pruners</a> for quick cuts,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hedge+Shears\" target=\"_blank\"> hedge shears</a>to clean up the edges, or<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Long+Handle+Tools\" target=\"_blank\"> long handle tools</a> to help with hard-to-reach spots, we’ve got what you need. </p><p>We also stock<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hand+Saws\" target=\"_blank\"> hand saws</a> for thicker limbs and a reliable mix of<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Striking+Tools\" target=\"_blank\"> striking tools</a> for the heavier jobs. Our goal is to make every yard project feel a little easier, no matter how big or small the task. To make things even more convenient, we deliver straight to Aspen and the surrounding areas—so you can get the tools you need without making the trip.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
